import{_ as t,o as i,c as a,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 923 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Article 22 | The Youth-Supreme Cultivation Mechanism","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 923 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Article 22 | The Youth-Supreme Cultivation Mechanism","no":923,"module":5,"tags":["Charter","Article 22","Youth Supreme","Cultivation Mechanism","Dual Route"],"related":["10-300 Origin Cultivation Systems Overview","37-Symbiotic Education System","17-Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standards"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0923_模块5-第二十二条-少年至尊培养机制.md","filePath":"en/0923_模块5-第二十二条-少年至尊培养机制.md"}'),o={name:"en/0923_模块5-第二十二条-少年至尊培养机制.md"};function r(s,e,l,u,h,c){return i(),a("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-923-myriad-rank-republican-civilizational-charter-·-article-22-the-youth-supreme-cultivation-mechanism" tabindex="-1">Entry 923 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Article 22 | The Youth-Supreme Cultivation Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-923-myriad-rank-republican-civilizational-charter-·-article-22-the-youth-supreme-cultivation-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 923 | Myriad-Rank Republican Civilizational Charter · Article 22 | The Youth-Supreme Cultivation Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Documents 10, 37, 17</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-youth-supremes-both-quick-and-questing" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Youth Supremes, both quick and questing <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-youth-supremes-both-quick-and-questing" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Youth Supremes, both quick and questing&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Youth Supremes — those who display extraordinary cultivation talent while young — are civilization&#39;s most precious yet most carefully treated seeds. Article 22 stipulates the Youth-Supreme cultivation mechanism: not the old age&#39;s &quot;genius = predation machine&quot; road, but the &quot;quick + quest&quot; dual route in parallel. On one hand use Multiplication Fruit and mentor network to accelerate growth; on the other hand in the Quest Sediment Domain retain their hardship tempering, avoiding a genius rocketing up yet with empty heart-nature and growing into a high-risk individual.</p><p>This article is from beginning to end placed under the six top-level axioms — the anti-predation axiom draws the bottom line, the republican axiom of Myriad Races establishes the subject, the collective-ascension axiom sets the direction, the causal self-discipline axiom guards the boundary, the law-first axiom preserves self-consistency; the five together constitute this article&#39;s insurmountable spiritual boundary.</p><p>Together with the previous five axioms, this article is also bound by Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing and layabouts retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose more and higher levels of infinity; predation thus fundamentally loses meaning.</p><h2 id="i-jurisprudential-basis" tabindex="-1">I. Jurisprudential Basis <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-jurisprudential-basis" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Jurisprudential Basis&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This article is based on the 300 Origin Cultivation Systems Overview (Document 10)&#39;s &quot;Youth-Supreme-exclusive dual route&quot; design, the Symbiotic Education System (Document 37), and the Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standards (Document 17)&#39;s heart-nature dimension. Its jurisprudence is: talent is talent, not a get-out-of-jail-free card. If a Youth Supreme only quickens without tempering, his heart-nature dimension (25 of the four-dimensional assessment) will necessarily fail, eventually growing into a high-risk individual with great force yet unreliable. The dual route is precisely to let genius be both fast and upright.</p><h2 id="ii-normative-content-how-the-dual-route-runs" tabindex="-1">II. Normative Content: How the Dual Route Runs <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-normative-content-how-the-dual-route-runs" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Normative Content: How the Dual Route Runs&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Article 22 breaks Youth-Supreme cultivation into dual tracks:</p><ol><li><strong>Quick line</strong>: enjoy Multiplication-Fruit-technologized hundredfold deduction amplification, top-mentor matching, targeted resource allocation;</li><li><strong>Quest line</strong>: in the Quest Sediment Domain retain the hardship-growth branch, experiencing real predicaments, failures, and responsibility; heart-nature and responsibility are simultaneously tempered;</li><li><strong>Synchronized assessment</strong>: quick progress and quest tempering are assessed by proportion, neither dispensable; those only quickening without questing are not granted high certification;</li><li><strong>Anti-predation lock</strong>: Youth Supremes from initiation receive anti-predation ethics education; no matter how high the talent, they may not predate for quick results.</li></ol><h2 id="iii-scope" tabindex="-1">III. Scope <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-scope" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Scope&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This article applies to all youths identified with Supreme talent, across the human race and the five lineages. This article especially protects Youth Supremes from old forces &quot;picking the peaches&quot; — no one may dig a Youth Supreme out of the cultivation mechanism to cultivate their own thug and force them onto a predatory road. The Youth Supreme himself retains an exit mechanism; talent is no reason for compulsion.</p><h2 id="iv-consequences-of-violation" tabindex="-1">IV. Consequences of Violation <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-consequences-of-violation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Consequences of Violation&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Cultivating Youth Supremes as predation tools, opening a &quot;heart-nature inspection-exempt&quot; back door for them, poaching Youth Supremes for private forces, using talent theory to force them to bear tasks against their will, all constitute unconstitutionality under this article. Consequences: relevant cultivation relationships are voided, the Youth Supreme returns to the universal cultivation mechanism; those using Supreme talent as leverage for personal control are pursued under spiritual enslavement (Article 1).</p><h2 id="v-supervision-mechanism" tabindex="-1">V. Supervision Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-supervision-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Supervision Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This article is executed by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision: the Youth Supreme&#39;s quick and quest dual-track progress is synchronously recorded, and the heart-nature dimension is included in four-dimensional pre-assessment; the Anchor Supervisory Committee monitors whether the Youth Supreme&#39;s cultivation environment is healthy, discovering exploitation or control immediately intervenes to protect.</p><h2 id="vi-a-genius-well-protected" tabindex="-1">VI. A Genius Well Protected <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-a-genius-well-protected" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. A Genius Well Protected&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Article 22&#39;s most precious picture is a genius well protected. A youth awakening Supreme aptitude young, both enjoys Multiplication Fruit and top-mentor acceleration, and is placed in the Quest Sediment Domain to experience real failure, responsibility, and predicament. He is not dried up in haste as a predation tool because of extraordinary talent, nor poached by old forces as a private soldier. The dual route lets his force and heart-nature grow together; by adulthood, both fast and upright. The Youth-Supreme mechanism proves: talent is worth accelerating, but more worth protecting — a genius well protected will grow up to protect Myriad Ranks in turn.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><p><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: a genius wasted on a predatory road is civilization&#39;s greatest loss; the dual route lets his talent truly serve symbiosis</p></li><li><p><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: from the cultivation source, puts an end to the old logic of &quot;genius = predator seedling&quot;</p></li><li><p><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-type protagonists rise young and are swept by fate into predation; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Youth Supremes dual route, heart-nature and force grow in step</p></li><li><p><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: Supreme-talent identification covers Myriad Ranks, not only human youths</p></li><li><p><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: cultivation technology and experience are network-wide shared, every clan may identify and cultivate its own Supreme</p></li><li><p><strong>Universal equal infinity</strong>: every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing layabouts retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose higher-level infinity; predation thus fundamentally loses meaning</p></li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Youth-Supreme cultivation mechanism is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s most responsible attitude toward &quot;genius.&quot; It acknowledges genius, accelerates genius, yet does not indulge genius; it makes talent Myriad Ranks&#39; wealth, not one person&#39;s or one group&#39;s private soldiers. When the youth are strong, Myriad Ranks are strong.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/10-三百套本源修炼体系总览.html">Entry 10 · 300 Origin Cultivation Systems Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/37-共生教育体系.html">Entry 37 · Symbiotic Education System</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/17-位面至高强者标准.html">Entry 17 · Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standards</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/911_模块5-第十条-位面至高强者四维考核.html">Entry 911 · Article 10 Four-Dimensional Assessment of Plane-Sovereign Strong Ones</a></li></ul>',25)])])}const m=t(o,[["render",r]]);export{p as __pageData,m as default};
